        "@value": "Country Boys"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Country Boys is a tribute to the music of Alan Jackson, Garth Brooks, Brad Paisley and George Strait.\r\nImagine a concert with these four Country music icons together on one stage at the same time.... The Country Boys Show will bring your there!    We are so excited to have them choose our venue as part of their tour!  "
      }
    ],
