        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us on August 24th for an extraordinary 2-hour concert featuring the incredibly talented Jolene Harnish, with a special appearance by the renowned guitarist, Keven Daken. The stage will [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us on August 24th for an extraordinary 2-hour concert featuring the incredibly talented Jolene Harnish, with a special appearance by the renowned guitarist, Keven Daken. The stage will come alive with soulful melodies and captivating performances that are sure to leave you spellbound. With Jolene's enchanting vocals and Keven's mesmerizing guitar skills, this musical"
      }
